# Input

```scss
@use "sass:math";
$feature: "hover";
$condition: "(display: grid)";
.a{
 interpolated-feature:if(media((#{$feature})): red; else: blue);
 namespaced-bound:if(media(math.$pi < width): red; else: blue);
 legacy-media:if(media(#{$condition}), red, blue);
 legacy-supports:if(supports(#{$condition}), red, blue);
 parent-suffix:if(supports(selector(&+100)): red; else: blue);
 width: 1px;
}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@use "sass:math";
$feature: "hover";
$condition: "(display: grid)";
.a {
	interpolated-feature: if(media((#{$feature})): red; else: blue);
	namespaced-bound: if(media(math.$pi < width): red; else: blue);
	legacy-media: if(media(#{$condition}), red, blue);
	legacy-supports: if(supports(#{$condition}), red, blue);
	parent-suffix: if(supports(selector(&+100)): red; else: blue);
	width: 1px;
}

```
